Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:51:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add OAR App Identity Starter community template

Next.js (Solana Kit) starter that prepares an Open App Registry (OAR)
App ID, manifest, and reciprocal domain and repository proofs from a
public creator address, offline. Devnet only. No keys, no signing, no
transactions: registration and program linking happen in the user's
own wallet. Generated metadata via pnpm generate; lockfile adds only
this template's importer.
